# GitHub Linguist leaves prose languages out of a repository's language bar by
# default. This repository is 37 markdown files and 3 accessory scripts, so the
# default reports it as "Python" — which is the one language it is least about,
# and puts it in the wrong bucket for anyone browsing or filtering by language.
#
# The documents are the product. Count them.
*.md linguist-detectable=true

# Examples are documentation of output, not vendored or generated material;
# keep them counted too rather than letting the default heuristics hide them.
examples/*.md linguist-detectable=true
